\ Binary monomorph-lite dispatch: `bitand` is a generic native with two
\ operands, and its PIC path always emits cold interpreter-callback branches,
\ so this program could not build under the lock before. With two
\ statically-proven fixnum operands the site compiles to one direct dispatch
\ call with no fallback; a successful locked build is itself the proof. The
\ result lands opaque (output-type propagation is a separate capability), so
\ correctness of the value is covered by the interpreter suite, not here.
12 10 bitand drop
